    <h1>Weather Satellite Taiwan</h1>
    <p class="landing-hero__lead">A Taiwan-only weather imagery app that pulls satellite, radar, temperature, and precipitation maps from Taiwan's Central Weather Administration (CWA) and plays each one as a time-lapse animation. Known on the device as <strong>天氣衛星圖 / Weather Satellite</strong>, it opens 18 imagery feeds from a single menu grid.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.boolint.weathertw" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Get it on Google Play
      </a>
